# mcp-server-nucleus v0.1.0 — Launch Walkthrough

**Published:** December 27, 2025  
**PyPI:** [mcp-server-nucleus](https://pypi.org/project/mcp-server-nucleus/0.1.0/)

---

## 🎯 What Was Built

A production-ready MCP (Model Context Protocol) server that bridges AI agents with a local "Nuclear Brain" system.

### Core Features

| Tool | Purpose |
|------|---------|
| [brain_emit_event](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#195-199) | Emit events to the ledger |
| [brain_read_events](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#200-204) | Read recent events |
| [brain_get_state](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#205-209) | Query brain state |
| [brain_update_state](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#210-214) | Update brain state |
| [brain_read_artifact](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#215-219) | Read artifact files |
| [brain_write_artifact](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#220-224) | Write artifact files |
| [brain_list_artifacts](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#225-229) | List all artifacts |
| [brain_trigger_agent](file:///Users/lokeshgarg/ai-mvp-backend/mcp-server-nucleus/src/mcp_server_nucleus/__init__.py#230-234) | Trigger agent with task |

