## 📦 Package Structure

```
mcp-server-nucleus/
├── pyproject.toml          # Hatch build config
├── LICENSE                  # MIT
├── README.md                # With badges & docs
└── src/mcp_server_nucleus/
    ├── __init__.py          # Core logic + MCP wrappers
    └── __main__.py          # Entry point
```

---

## ✅ Verification Performed

1. **Local validation script** — All 8 tools tested against `.brain/`
2. **Claude Desktop integration** — Confirmed MCP connection working
3. **Real query test** — "What's my sprint focus?" returned correct data
4. **Wheel install test** — Package installs and runs correctly

---

## 🔧 Claude Desktop Config

```json
{
  "mcpServers": {
    "nucleus-brain": {
      "command": "python3",
      "args": ["-m", "mcp_server_nucleus"],
      "env": {
        "NUCLEAR_BRAIN_PATH": "/path/to/your/.brain"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

